 "notes": [
  "A crest is rank (laurel, drawn first) + frame + emblem stamped at the frame's slot + up to three pips at pipPositions.",
  "Character grids with palette roles, like pets.v1 and badge.json; '.' is transparent and a later layer only paints its non-transparent cells.",
  "Roles C, D, H take the crew color's base, shade and highlight (crewColors); o is the emblem outline, the crew color's emblemOutline (the pet outline, or a rim gray on dark crews); g and h take the rank's leaf and shade (ranks).",
  "Nearest-neighbor only: 1 sprite px per pt at 32 pt, 1.5 pt per sprite px at 48 pt (3 device px on Retina), 4x and up on the crew page."
